      "width": 662.242919921875,
      "height": 30,
      "text": "Pulse watches the graph for conflicts, drift and missing ownership, then shows the evidence behind each warning.\nContradictions rank highest, followed by code drift, ownership gaps, missing rationale and stale decisions.",
